xt":"去迎接  未到达的终点"},{"time":187.18,"text":"往事又浮现  眼泪坠落心间"},{"time":192.6,"text":"还有多少句话 没能表达"},{"time":198.07,"text":"时间不停歇 仍继续往前"},{"time":204.85,"text":"擦擦泪 注目明天"}]},{"title":"2 In White","lyrics":[{"time":14.14,"text":"I rub away the sleep, wearing on the precious plight"},{"time":20.84,"text":"I saw you there, dear, with a smile that's beaming, piercing through the night"},{"time":29.7,"text":"How so bright, like a gem, hooking my eyes"},{"time":35.15,"text":"As I with no doubt, tread into the dream, once again"},{"time":40.46,"text":"A place where blossoms blooming, you with me"},{"time":49.23,"text":"Into my skin your warmth it seeps"},{"time":52.58,"text":"As if you soothe away the pain and all my dried weeps"},{"time":60.11,"text":"\"Time to leave\""},{"time":70.6,"text":"I step into the ride, oh but I, I no more have you by my side"},{"time":79.46,"text":"The sky, it feels for me, so it cries in white"},{"time":84.96,"text":"I walk on through the woes, all alone, for nothing but to have you mourned"},{"time":93.36,"text":"Down on this road will I go"},{"time":98.67,"text":"When frost it colds, leaving motions froze"},{"time":105.64,"text":"I with no hesitating break from its hold"},{"time":112.93,"text":"When leaves they fall, rendering timbers bald"},{"time":119.95,"text":"Will I not by any means let it rot out my soul"},{"time":153.76,"text":"A place where blossoms blooming, you with me"},{"time":162.11,"text":"Into my skin your warmth it seeps"},{"time":165.54,"text":"As if you soothe away the pain and all my dried weeps"},{"time":173.08,"text":"\"Time to deed\""},{"time":183.15,"text":"I step into the ride, oh and I, I'll never have you by my side"},{"time":192.27,"text":"The sky, it feels for me, so it cries in white"},{"time":197.83,"text":"I walk on through the woes, all alone, for nothing but to have you mourned"},{"time":206.26,"text":"Down on this road will I choose to go"},{"time":211.41,"text":"When all the frost it colds, leaving motions froze"},{"time":218.9,"text":"I with no hesitating burn from its hold"},{"time":225.86,"text":"When leaves they fall, rendering timbers bald"},{"time":232.96,"text":"Will I walk right to where you rest in repose, in calm"}]},{"title":"3 爱意痉挛","lyrics":[{"time":15.1,"text":"想过了"},{"time":16.04,"text":"荼靡它折磨一些失温的情绪"},{"time":18.46,"text":"假意邂逅"},{"time":20.01,"text":"还是勾出胸腔鲜红的歌"},{"time":22.01,"text":"装作收尾"},{"time":23.98,"text":"加权三十三封琢磨"},{"time":25.83,"text":"染疾春歌"},{"time":27.78,"text":"它知道森森的"},{"time":29.1,"text":"心病也潮湿了"},{"time":31.1,"text":"而歌声模糊一切模糊淋漓的"},{"time":33.33,"text":"模糊血肉"},{"time":35.13,"text":"而歌声清晰昨天清晰的"},{"time":37.13,"text":"过曝晴空"},{"time":39.01,"text":"痴云滴着焚风在问"},{"time":40.94,"text":"我们呢"},{"time":43.1,"text":"“因疾而终的甜腻幽默”"},{"time":45.47,"text":"你看风筝不会说"},{"time":47.74,"text":"挣脱冰凉渔线后的"},{"time":49.34,"text":"歪曲痕迹和坠毁"},{"time":51.48,"text":"通向快乐"},{"time":53.34,"text":"这支干燥枯了墨的"},{"time":55.21,"text":"挣扎兜圈迷茫红色"},{"time":56.9,"text":"不能勾出多油润的"},{"time":59.25,"text":"但是够了"},{"time":60.94,"text":"谁爱着 垂涎罂粟的恶"},{"time":66.24,"text":"反而才 证明"},{"time":68.39,"text":"它怨着 愿意的"},{"time":71.95,"text":"堕落的 神色"},{"time":75.06,"text":"它是我"},{"time":76.17,"text":"绵延和承托了悬疑的惊心的"},{"time":78.33,"text":"想象国"},{"time":80.05,"text":"逃开了然而没能决绝地"},{"time":82.06,"text":"拒绝 对么"},{"time":84.03,"text":"善良流到可怜终末"},{"time":85.87,"text":"也成了 尸首"},{"time":88.59,"text":"安宁吧 亲爱的"},{"time":105.99,"text":"静默之中"},{"time":106.93,"text":"无须担忧 无须承诺"},{"time":108.82,"text":"无须和微笑交待什么可爱的"},{"time":110.89,"text":"切了皮肤切了黏膜"},{"time":112.1,"text":"才安稳"},{"time":113.24,"text":"静默才能够"},{"time":114.36,"text":"厘清它 如何编纂"},{"time":116.2,"text":"嗡鸣和魔咒"},{"time":117.42,"text":"才能拥着凝练中"},{"time":118.48,"text":"除了文字除了神经"},{"time":119.4,"text":"的全部过错"},{"time":121.04,"text":"而歌声模糊一切模糊淋漓的"},{"time":123.38,"text":"模糊印记"},{"time":125.06,"text":"而歌声清晰昨天清晰的"},{"time":127.09,"text":"过热空气"},{"time":128.94,"text":"深蓝揉着蝉声在笑"},{"time":130.73,"text":"我们呢"},{"time":132.93,"text":"“滑向惊颤的乏味存活”"},{"time":135.79,"text":